gic event so this  year will be saturday september 10th on  the lawn at downtown summerlin and i  usually invite all of we have so many  great teachers here in las vegas so i  invite a lot of the teachers who've been  teaching for a long time all the  favorite teachers to come and teach like  a round robin style class it's all  different styles of yoga we have vinyasa  kunilini hatha we have a big gong bath  we all my kunilini teachers surround the  field with our gongs and we do that and  we just raise a lot of money so  it's an 11 minimum donation ticks are  available on eventbrite and you can we  have a lot of awesome raffle prizes and  stuff available the day of the event  well that's incredible everything you  are doing and are all levels of welcome  sometimes  people are on their heads  bring your kids bring your dogs  bring you know your whole family it's  definitely a family evening it's it's a  very magical evening and i don't know if  you've been on the lawn at downtown  summer at night but they have all the  twinkle lights and it's just always a  way to bring the whole community  together for me it's not about  one studio it's about the entire yoga  community in las vegas and we're very  blessed here in las vegas to have the  community that we do well amelia rachel  thank you both so much for being here  we're excited to continue to support  yoga for a cause i love everything that  you're doing in the community thank you  ladies for being here thank you and  we'll just all live in peace  thanks amelia  jc all
 

